{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>WiZMA 是一款為 3 至 8 歲兒童家庭而設的親子共學應用，把個人化故事、趣味活動、正向日常習慣與家長儀錶板整合於同一個體驗之中。家長負責引導，孩子則透過故事、對話與遊戲探索，在無壓力、無比較的氣氛下累積小進步。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-173.webp\">\n<h2>故事互動與習慣培養</h2>\n<p>WiZMA 可依據孩子的興趣與日常情境生成專屬故事，並透過情節協助孩子辨認、命名與表達情緒。應用同時提供鼓勵式的簡單日常流程，幫助孩子建立正向習慣，另有多元親子活動建議，方便安排優質的共處時光。家長儀錶板會記錄活動、習慣與進度，讓家長掌握孩子的成長步伐，不必與他人比較。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-198-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-199-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-200-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-201-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-202-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-203-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：WiZMA</li>\n<li>應用類別：Entertainment</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T10:00:37.122720+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":318,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T09:43:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T11:17:46.792323+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T09:57:40.174074+00:00","content_hash":"8dd64bf2d13c403bfbd33f3ebfbc539224b8f05b6b32efafa6712c320972f26f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}